                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "I mostly work on the frontend with React, Next.js and TypeScript, and I own features end to end: planning with product stakeholders, building, releasing, and maintaining them afterwards — across internal tools and user-facing products.",
