                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Along the way I've migrated legacy codebases, built real-time dashboards, and turned manual workflows into internal tools. These days I'm expanding into full-stack work with Node.js, Hono, NestJS and PostgreSQL.",
